# Drone mode naming

The third drone state is **`THE_LAST_OF_EE2028`**, not `LAST_OF_2028` or any `TEST_OF_*` variant.

## Required names

| Kind | Correct | Forbidden |
|------|---------|-----------|
| Enum / state | `THE_LAST_OF_EE2028` | `LAST_OF_2028`, `TEST_OF_2028`, `TEST_OF_EE2028`, `TEST_OF_EE_2028` |
| Handler | `Handle_The_Last_Of_EE2028_Mode` | `Handle_Last_Of_2028_Mode`, `Handle_EE2028_Mode`, `Handle_Test_Of_*` |
| Prose / docs | "The Last of EE2028" | "Last of 2028", "Test of EE2028", "Test of 2028" |
| Display text | `THE LAST OF EE2028` | `LAST OF 2028` |

## Examples

```c
// ❌ BAD
case LAST_OF_2028:
    Handle_Last_Of_2028_Mode();

case TEST_OF_EE2028:
    Handle_EE2028_Mode();

// ✅ GOOD
case THE_LAST_OF_EE2028:
    Handle_The_Last_Of_EE2028_Mode();
```

If you see a forbidden name in a diff or existing file, rename it to the correct form before finishing the task.
